# macOS Finder metadata — never content
.DS_Store

# Derived caches: `gov.py state` rewrites these from the vN/ sources on every run.
# Everything else under _state/ IS tracked (approvals, gate and analyze records, briefs).
**/_state/current-*.md
**/_state/traceability.md
**/_state/state.json

# Implementer receipts — per-run, not governance
**/modules/*/**/receipts/

# An implementer session runs inside this checkout (runner --cd): its own files are never the project's —
# except the usage skills `gov.py given add` installs under .claude/skills/, which ARE the project's
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
